      en: "The Holy Spirit Church in Kolwezi, built in 1960, is a modernist Catholic church serving the Lualaba province. Its concrete bell tower rises 35 meters and is a local landmark. The church seats 2,000 people and features stained glass windows installed in 1995 depicting Pentecost scenes. The parish runs a primary school with 300 students and a community health clinic. Annual Pentecost celebrations include a procession through the streets of Kolwezi. The building underwent a major renovation in 2010, including a new roof and upgraded facilities.",
